(function() {
    'use strict';

    class PandemiaAdapter extends USF.SimulationAdapter {
        constructor() {
            super();
            this.name = 'La Pandemia';
            this.version = '1.1.0';

            this.ROUNDS = [
                {
                    nameEn: 'Immediate Triage: Workforce Decisions',
                    nameEs: 'Triaje Inmediato: Decisiones de Personal',
                    icon: '\u26A0',
                    controls: 'round1Controls'
                },
                {
                    nameEn: 'Creditor Negotiation & Government Relief',
                    nameEs: 'Negociacion con Acreedores y Gobierno',
                    icon: '\uD83C\uDFE6',
                    controls: 'round2Controls'
                },
                {
                    nameEn: 'Operations: Stay Open or Shut Down?',
                    nameEs: 'Operaciones: Abrir o Cerrar?',
                    icon: '\uD83C\uDFE8',
                    controls: 'round3Controls'
                },
                {
                    nameEn: 'Recovery Planning',
                    nameEs: 'Planificacion de Recuperacion',
                    icon: '\uD83D\uDCC8',
                    controls: 'round4Controls'
                }
            ];

            this.BRIEFINGS_EN = [
                '<strong>72 hours after government announcement.</strong><br><br>The Ministry of Health has ordered: border closures, events banned for 50+ people, hotels at 25% max capacity. Occupancy has crashed from 75% to 5%. Revenue collapses 95%.<br><br>With $3M cash and $1.67M monthly burn, you have <strong style="color:#ff4444">6-8 weeks of runway</strong>. Workforce costs are $1.4M/month of the $1.8M total fixed costs.<br><br>You MUST decide now: how do you restructure the workforce to survive?',
                '<strong>Week 2 — Financial Survival.</strong><br><br>Workforce decisions are done. Now the CFO faces two fronts:<br><br><strong style="color:#58a6ff">Bank debt ($12M):</strong> You can request a payment moratorium. The bank may grant 3 months (saving $180K) but will reclassify the loan as non-performing. A 6-month request is riskier — lower odds of approval.<br><br><strong style="color:#58a6ff">Government relief:</strong> Honduras announces a payroll subsidy program: 50% of retained employee salaries for 90 days. Expected amount: ~$210K. But timing and actual payout are uncertain.',
                '<strong>Month 2 — The Big Question.</strong><br><br>With the runway extended by workforce cuts and financial relief, the CEO faces a critical decision:<br><br><strong style="color:#3fb950">Option A — Minimal Operations:</strong> Keep 2 of 5 hotels open (Tegucigalpa + San Pedro Sula). Revenue ~$350K/mo but costs ~$800K/mo. Maintains market presence, easier to reactivate.<br><br><strong style="color:#f0883e">Option B — Full Closure:</strong> Shut all 5 hotels. Keep 15 security/maintenance staff. Costs drop to ~$300K/mo. Preserves cash but properties deteriorate and reopening costs more.',
                '<strong>Month 4 — Planning for 12-18 Months Ahead.</strong><br><br>The pandemic will likely last 12-18 months. You need a recovery plan:<br><br><strong style="color:#bc8cff">Pivot options:</strong> Convert hotel rooms into a government quarantine facility (100 rooms at $30/night = $90K/month). Different from normal hospitality, but it keeps occupancy up.<br><br><strong style="color:#bc8cff">Financing:</strong> Government emergency loans ($2M at favorable terms), shareholder capital injection ($1.5M), or both. More capital means survival, but debt rises from $12M to $14-15M.'
            ];

            this.BRIEFINGS_ES = [
                '<strong>72 horas despues del anuncio del gobierno.</strong><br><br>El Ministerio de Salud ordena: cierre de fronteras, eventos prohibidos para mas de 50 personas, hoteles a 25% de capacidad. La ocupacion cae de 75% a 5%. Los ingresos colapsan un 95%.<br><br>Con $3M en efectivo y $1.67M de consumo mensual, tiene <strong style="color:#ff4444">6-8 semanas de runway</strong>. Los costos de personal son $1.4M/mes de $1.8M en costos fijos totales.<br><br>DEBE decidir ahora: como reestructura la fuerza laboral para sobrevivir?',
                '<strong>Semana 2 — Supervivencia Financiera.</strong><br><br>Las decisiones de personal estan tomadas. El CFO enfrenta dos frentes:<br><br><strong style="color:#58a6ff">Deuda bancaria ($12M):</strong> Puede solicitar moratorio de pagos. El banco puede otorgar 3 meses (ahorro $180K) pero reclasifica el prestamo como improductivo. Una solicitud de 6 meses es mas riesgosa.<br><br><strong style="color:#58a6ff">Programa de gobierno:</strong> Honduras anuncia subsidio de nomina: 50% de salarios del personal retenido por 90 dias. Monto esperado: ~$210K. Pero el momento y el pago real son inciertos.',
                '<strong>Mes 2 — La Gran Pregunta.</strong><br><br>Con el runway extendido, el CEO enfrenta una decision critica:<br><br><strong style="color:#3fb950">Opcion A — Operacion Minima:</strong> Mantener 2 de 5 hoteles abiertos (Tegucigalpa + San Pedro Sula). Ingresos ~$350K/mes pero costos ~$800K/mes. Mantiene presencia, mas facil de reactivar.<br><br><strong style="color:#f0883e">Opcion B — Cierre Total:</strong> Cerrar los 5 hoteles. Solo 15 personas de seguridad/mantenimiento. Costos bajan a ~$300K/mes. Preserva efectivo pero las propiedades se deterioran.',
                '<strong>Mes 4 — Planificando 12-18 meses adelante.</strong><br><br>La pandemia durara 12-18 meses. Necesita un plan de recuperacion:<br><br><strong style="color:#bc8cff">Opciones de pivot:</strong> Convertir habitaciones en centro de cuarentena gubernamental (100 habitaciones a $30/noche = $90K/mes). Diferente a hospitalidad normal, pero mantiene ocupacion.<br><br><strong style="color:#bc8cff">Financiamiento:</strong> Prestamos de emergencia del gobierno ($2M con terminos favorables), inyeccion de capital del accionista ($1.5M), o ambos. Mas capital significa supervivencia, pero la deuda sube de $12M a $14-15M.'
            ];
        }

        /* ── i18n helpers ── */
        // The USF framework's language property is `lang` (NOT `language`/`currentLanguage`).
        // Reading `.currentLanguage` returned undefined and forced English on Spanish runs.
        _lang() {
            try {
                var s = window.mySimulation;
                var l = (s && (s.lang || s.language || s.currentLanguage)) ||
                        (document.documentElement && document.documentElement.lang) || 'en';
                return String(l).toLowerCase().slice(0, 2);
            } catch (e) { return 'en'; }
        }
        _t(key) {
            try { return window.mySimulation.t(key); }
            catch (e) {
                var tr = this.getTranslations();
                var lang = this._lang() === 'es' ? 'es' : 'en';
                var tbl = tr[lang] || tr.en || {};
                return (tbl[key] != null) ? tbl[key] : key;
            }
        }

        initialize(state) {
            if (!state.domainState || Object.keys(state.domainState).length === 0) {
                state.domainState = {
                    cash: 3000000,
                    employees: 280,
                    monthlyBurn: 1672000,
                    runwayWeeks: 7,
                    hotelsOpen: 5,
                    occupancy: 5,
                    debtBalance: 12000000,
                    monthlyRevenue: 128000,
                    monthlyFixedCosts: 1800000,
                    monthlyPayroll: 1400000,
                    severancePaid: 0,
                    moratoriumSavings: 0,
                    govReliefReceived: 0,
                    pivotRevenue: 0,
                    financingReceived: 0,
                    cashHistory: [3000000],
                    burnHistory: [1672000],
                    roundDecisions: []
                };
            }
            if (!state.decisions || Object.keys(state.decisions).length === 0) {
                state.decisions = {
                    workforceStrategy: 'D',
                    moratorium: '3mo',
                    relief: 'conservative',
                    operationsMode: 'minimal',
                    pivot: 'quarantine',
                    financing: 'both'
                };
            }
            this._updateBriefing(state);

            // The framework's Undo reverts state/history/charts but does NOT know about this
            // adapter's briefing text or the per-round control panels. Re-render them after the
            // framework processes the undo (defer to the next tick so its handler runs first).
            if (!this._bound) {
                this._bound = true;
                var self = this;
                var undoBtn = document.getElementById('undoBtn');
                if (undoBtn) {
                    undoBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
                        setTimeout(function() {
                            try { self._updateBriefing(window.mySimulation.state); } catch (e) {}
                        }, 0);
                    });
                }
            }
        }

        validateDecisions(decisions) {
            var period = window.mySimulation.state.currentPeriod || 1;

            if (period === 1) {
                var ws = document.getElementById('workforceSelect');
                if (ws) decisions.workforceStrategy = ws.value;
                if (!decisions.workforceStrategy) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('select_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }
            } else if (period === 2) {
                var ms = document.getElementById('moratoriumSelect');
                if (ms) decisions.moratorium = ms.value;
                var rs = document.getElementById('reliefSelect');
                if (rs) decisions.relief = rs.value;
            } else if (period === 3) {
                var os = document.getElementById('operationsSelect');
                if (os) decisions.operationsMode = os.value;
            } else if (period === 4) {
                var ps = document.getElementById('pivotSelect');
                if (ps) decisions.pivot = ps.value;
                var fs = document.getElementById('financingSelect');
                if (fs) decisions.financing = fs.value;
            }
            this._updateBriefing(window.mySimulation.state);
            return true;
        }

        calculateResults(state) {
            var d = state.decisions;
            var ds = state.domainState;
            var period = state.currentPeriod;
            var cashImpact = 0;
            var description = '';
            var newBurn = ds.monthlyBurn;

            if (period === 1) {
                var severance = 0;
                var payrollSavings = 0;
                var retained = 280;

                if (d.workforceStrategy === 'A') {
                    severance = 2000000;
                    payrollSavings = 1200000;
                    retained = 84;
                    description = this._t('desc_wf_a');
                } else if (d.workforceStrategy === 'B') {
                    severance = 0;
                    payrollSavings = 700000;
                    retained = 140;
                    description = this._t('desc_wf_b');
                } else if (d.workforceStrategy === 'C') {
                    severance = 0;
                    payrollSavings = 700000;
                    retained = 280;
                    description = this._t('desc_wf_c');
                } else {
                    severance = 800000;
                    payrollSavings = 900000;
                    retained = 168;
                    description = this._t('desc_wf_d');
                }

                ds.severancePaid = severance;
                ds.cash -= severance;
                ds.employees = retained;
                ds.monthlyPayroll = 1400000 - payrollSavings;
                newBurn = ds.monthlyFixedCosts - payrollSavings - ds.monthlyRevenue;
                ds.monthlyBurn = newBurn;
                cashImpact = -severance;

            } else if (period === 2) {
                var morSavings = 0;
                if (d.moratorium === '3mo') {
                    morSavings = 180000;
                    description = this._t('desc_mor_3');
                } else if (d.moratorium === '6mo') {
                    var approved = Math.random() > 0.4;
                    if (approved) {
                        morSavings = 360000;
                        description = this._t('desc_mor_6ok');
                    } else {
                        morSavings = 180000;
                        description = this._t('desc_mor_6no');
                    }
                } else {
                    description = this._t('desc_mor_none');
                }

                var relief = 0;
                if (d.relief === 'conservative') {
                    relief = Math.round(210000 * (0.2 + Math.random() * 0.2));
                    description += ' + ' + this._t('desc_relief_conservative');
                } else if (d.relief === 'moderate') {
                    relief = Math.round(210000 * (0.35 + Math.random() * 0.3));
                    description += ' + ' + this._t('desc_relief_moderate');
                } else if (d.relief === 'optimistic') {
                    relief = Math.round(210000 * (0.5 + Math.random() * 0.35));
                    description += ' + ' + this._t('desc_relief_optimistic');
                } else {
                    description += ' + ' + this._t('desc_relief_none');
                }

                ds.moratoriumSavings = morSavings;
                ds.govReliefReceived = relief;
                ds.cash += morSavings + relief;
                cashImpact = morSavings + relief;
                newBurn = ds.monthlyBurn;

            } else if (period === 3) {
                var monthsSimulated = 3;

                if (d.operationsMode === 'minimal') {
                    ds.hotelsOpen = 2;
                    ds.occupancy = 12;
                    var minRevenue = 350000 * monthsSimulated;
                    var minCosts = 800000 * monthsSimulated;
                    cashImpact = minRevenue - minCosts;
                    ds.monthlyRevenue = 350000;
                    newBurn = 800000 - 350000;
                    description = this._t('desc_ops_min');
                } else {
                    ds.hotelsOpen = 0;
                    ds.occupancy = 0;
                    cashImpact = -(300000 * monthsSimulated);
                    ds.monthlyRevenue = 0;
                    newBurn = 300000;
                    description = this._t('desc_ops_closure');
                }

                ds.cash += cashImpact;
                ds.monthlyBurn = newBurn;

            } else if (period === 4) {
                var pivotIncome = 0;
                if (d.pivot === 'quarantine') {
                    pivotIncome = 90000 * 6;
                    ds.pivotRevenue = 90000;
                    ds.occupancy = Math.min(ds.occupancy + 25, 40);
                    description = this._t('desc_pivot_q');
                } else {
                    description = this._t('desc_pivot_none');
                }

                var financing = 0;
                if (d.financing === 'gov_loan') {
                    financing = 2000000;
                    ds.debtBalance += 2000000;
                    description += ' + ' + this._t('desc_fin_gov');
                } else if (d.financing === 'shareholder') {
                    financing = 1500000;
                    description += ' + ' + this._t('desc_fin_sh');
                } else if (d.financing === 'both') {
                    financing = 3500000;
                    ds.debtBalance += 2000000;
                    description += ' + ' + this._t('desc_fin_both');
                } else {
                    description += ' + ' + this._t('desc_fin_none');
                }

                ds.financingReceived = financing;
                ds.cash += pivotIncome + financing;
                cashImpact = pivotIncome + financing;
                if (ds.pivotRevenue > 0) {
                    ds.monthlyRevenue += ds.pivotRevenue;
                    ds.monthlyBurn = Math.max(0, ds.monthlyBurn - ds.pivotRevenue);
                }
            }

            ds.runwayWeeks = ds.monthlyBurn > 0 ? Math.round((ds.cash / ds.monthlyBurn) * 4.33) : 99;
            ds.cashHistory.push(ds.cash);
            ds.burnHistory.push(ds.monthlyBurn);
            ds.roundDecisions.push(description);

            var self = this;
            setTimeout(function() {
                self._updateBriefing({ currentPeriod: state.currentPeriod + 1 });
            }, 500);

            return {
                period: period,
                description: description,
                cashImpact: cashImpact,
                cash: ds.cash,
                employees: ds.employees,
                monthlyBurn: ds.monthlyBurn,
                runwayWeeks: ds.runwayWeeks,
                hotelsOpen: ds.hotelsOpen
            };
        }

        setupUI(uiManager) {
            uiManager.bind('currentDay', 'currentPeriod');
            uiManager.bind('maxPeriods', 'maxPeriods');
            uiManager.bind('cashDisplay', 'domainState.cash',
                function(v) { return '$' + Math.round(v).toLocaleString(); });
            uiManager.bind('employeesDisplay', 'domainState.employees');
            uiManager.bind('burnDisplay', 'domainState.monthlyBurn',
                function(v) { return '$' + Math.round(v).toLocaleString(); });
            uiManager.bind('runwayDisplay', 'domainState.runwayWeeks',
                function(v) { return v + ' wk'; });
            uiManager.bind('hotelsDisplay', 'domainState.hotelsOpen',
                function(v) { return v + '/5'; });
            uiManager.bind('occupancyDisplay', 'domainState.occupancy',
                function(v) { return v + '%'; });
